      "result": "1. **Fund the escrow:** The buyer posts the AI job and locks the agreed USDC amount into a smart contract escrow on Arc, where it stays until work is verified.\n\n2. **Deliver and verify:** The provider completes the job and submits results. Once the buyer (or an automated verifier/oracle) confirms the work meets requirements, the escrow releases USDC directly to the provider's wallet.\n\n3. **Earn reputation:** Successful settlement is recorded on-chain, building the provider's verifiable track record. Buyers can also leave ratings, and consistent successful jobs raise the provider's reputation score, attracting future work.\n\n(67 words)",
